{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41340","headline":"荆南席上咏胡琴妓二首 一 · 王仁裕","name":"荆南席上咏胡琴妓二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红妆齐抱紫檀槽，一抹朱弦四十条。\n湘水淩波惭鼓瑟，秦楼明月罢吹箫。\n寒敲白玉声偏婉，暖逼黄莺语自娇。\n丹禁旧臣来侧耳，骨清神爽似闻韶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}